<div class=chatlog__message-group><div id=chatlog__message-container-1558534169062023339 class=chatlog__message-container data-message-id=1558534169062023339><div class=chatlog__message><div class=chatlog__message-aside><img class=chatlog__avatar src=https://cdn.discordapp.com/embed/avatars/4.png alt=Avatar loading=lazy></div><div class=chatlog__message-primary><div class=chatlog__header><span class=chatlog__author title=dadventuressteve data-user-id=1264035953933156432>Veilocity</span> <span class=chatlog__timestamp title="Saturday, October 10, 2026 1:38 PM"><a href=#chatlog__message-container-1558534169062023339>10/10/2026 1:38 PM</a></span></div><div class="chatlog__content chatlog__markdown"><span class=chatlog__markdown-preserve><strong><img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#127754;"
    title="ocean"
    src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@latest/assets/svg/1f30a.svg"> एकैसाथ चार धाराहरू — खुसी, दुःख, शान्ति र पूर्णता <img
    loading="lazy"
    class="chatlog__emoji "
    alt="&#128330;️"
